-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ב/6 (15.6.2022), תשלום דמי הבראה ומענק יובל לשנת הלימודים
-- תשפ"ב.
-- The recuperation allowance for the school year תשפ"ב (when it is paid,
-- the day value, the days by seniority, part-time and multiple employers,
-- the limits on total employment) and the jubilee grant (who is entitled,
-- the amount, the seniority that counts, part-time and multiple employers).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשפ"ב/6 תשלום דמי הבראה ומענק יובל לשנת הלימודים תשפ"ב`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 The letterhead, the date and the reference number; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The circular's number, the addressees, the greeting and the subject line; no rule.

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months (common.l4:
-- September is 1, June is 10) of the school year תשפ"ב.

DECLARE `payment action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the recuperation allowance in full` HAS `recuperation amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the jubilee grant` HAS `jubilee amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `employ beyond the limit on total employment`

§§ `1 קצובת דמי הבראה`

@desc One employer's share of a teaching employee's employment in the school year.
DECLARE `employment at an employer` HAS
    `position fraction at this employer` IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held at this employer over the year (1 = one full position)

@desc A teaching employee's school year as far as the recuperation allowance asks about it.
DECLARE `recuperation employee` HAS
    `years of seniority in teaching` IS A NUMBER  @desc the employee's seniority in teaching, the year being served counted (the first year is 1)
    `employments`                    IS A LIST OF `employment at an employer`

-- §1א: "יש לשלם את קצובת דמי ההבראה במלואה במשכורת חודש יוני .2021". The
-- circular is dated 15.6.2022 and pays the allowance for the school year
-- תשפ"ב (1.9.2021-31.8.2022), so "2021" is a misprint for 2022, which a
-- reader sees past (§2א pays the jubilee grant with June 2022's salary);
-- the rule is written for June of the school year.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN e IS A `recuperation employee`, `the employer's share` IS A NUMBER @desc the allowance this employer owes, under sections 1ד-1ו
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `payment action`
DECIDE `paying the recuperation allowance with June's salary` e `the employer's share` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the recuperation allowance in full` paid
          PROVIDED paid AT LEAST `the employer's share`
    WITHIN `month number` June
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/6 §1א: the recuperation allowance is paid in full with June's salary"

@ref akn:art_1__para_b
`the value of a recuperation day` MEANS 449

@desc One printed row of §1ג's table: a band of seniority in teaching and its recuperation days.
DECLARE `recuperation band` HAS
    `band from year` IS A NUMBER
    `band to year`   IS A NUMBER  @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה", with no upper bound
    `band days`      IS A NUMBER

-- "3 שנים ראשונות" is years 1 to 3.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c
`the table of recuperation days` MEANS
    LIST `recuperation band` 1  3   7,
         `recuperation band` 4  10  9,
         `recuperation band` 11 15  10,
         `recuperation band` 16 19  11,
         `recuperation band` 20 24  12,
         `recuperation band` 25 999 13

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the days the table gives for year` n IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band days`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `band from year` AND n AT MOST b's `band to year`)
                `the table of recuperation days`)

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recuperation days` n IS
    sum (`the days the table gives for year` n)

-- The table gives every year from 1 to 40 exactly one row.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD count (`the days the table gives for year` n) EQUALS 1)
            (range 1 40)

GIVEN e IS A `recuperation employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position allowance` e IS
    `the value of a recuperation day` TIMES `recuperation days` (e's `years of seniority in teaching`)

-- §1ד: a part-time employee gets the allowance in proportion to the year's
-- position fraction, "1/10 לכל חודש עבודה". F-2021-22_tashpab_06-a: read
-- with the ten teaching months September-June, the year's fraction is the
-- average of the months' fractions over those ten.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d
GIVEN `monthly position fractions` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc the position fraction in each month of work, September to June
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the year's position fraction` `monthly position fractions` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN f YIELD f TIMES `the weight of a month of work`) `monthly position fractions`)

`the weight of a month of work` MEANS 1 DIVIDED BY 10

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_06-a: a teaching employee is paid salary for twelve
-- months of the school year; if each is a month of work at a tenth, a full
-- year comes to more than one whole year's position.
`twelve months of work at a tenth each come to more than a year` MEANS
    `the year's position fraction` (replicate 12 1) GREATER THAN 1
#ASSERT `twelve months of work at a tenth each come to more than a year`

-- §1ה: more than one full position with the same employer earns the
-- allowance of one full position only.
@ref akn:art_1__para_e
GIVEN j IS AN `employment at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position share at this employer` j IS
    min (j's `position fraction at this employer`) 1

-- §1ו: with more than one employer and more than 100% in all, each employer
-- pays the allowance in proportion to the position held with it.
@ref akn:art_1__para_f
GIVEN e IS A `recuperation employee`, j IS AN `employment at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the recuperation allowance at an employer` e j IS
    `the full-position allowance` e TIMES `the position share at this employer` j

@export The recuperation allowance for the school year תשפ"ב that one employer owes a teaching employee under circular תשפ"ב/6
GIVEN e IS A `recuperation employee` @desc the employee
      j IS AN `employment at an employer` @desc the employee's employment at the paying employer
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the recuperation allowance owed by the employer` e j IS
    `the recuperation allowance at an employer` e j

GIVEN e IS A `recuperation employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the recuperation allowance from all employers` e IS
    sum (map (GIVEN j YIELD `the recuperation allowance at an employer` e j) (e's `employments`))

-- §§1ז-1ח: the limits on total employment with all employers, by track.
@desc The employment tracks §§1ז-1ח name.
DECLARE `employment track` IS ONE OF
    `a teacher not employed under a reform`
    `a principal not employed under a reform`
    `a teacher under Oz LaTmura in full implementation`
    `a teacher under Ofek Hadash`

@ref akn:art_1__para_g akn:art_1__para_h
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the limit on total employment in sections 1ז-1ח` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `a teacher not employed under a reform` THEN 1.40
    WHEN `a principal not employed under a reform` THEN 1.50
    WHEN `a teacher under Oz LaTmura in full implementation` THEN 1.25
    WHEN `a teacher under Ofek Hadash` THEN 1.17

-- §1ח ¶4 restates the limits by reform only: "140% משרה -ללא רפורמה 125%,
-- משרה ביישום מלא של עוז לתמורה ו 117% -באופק חדש".
@ref akn:art_1__para_h/p4
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the limit on total employment as ¶4 restates it` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `a teacher under Oz LaTmura in full implementation` THEN 1.25
    WHEN `a teacher under Ofek Hadash` THEN 1.17
    OTHERWISE 1.40

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_06-b: for a principal not under a reform, §1ז sets 150%
-- and ¶4's restatement of "these scopes" 140%.
`section 1ז and its restatement give a principal outside the reforms different limits` MEANS
    NOT (`the limit on total employment in sections 1ז-1ח` `a principal not employed under a reform`
         EQUALS `the limit on total employment as ¶4 restates it` `a principal not employed under a reform`)
#ASSERT `section 1ז and its restatement give a principal outside the reforms different limits`

-- The reading adopted: §1ז, the clause that sets the limit, governs; the
-- restatement adds no limit of its own. ¶2-3: the limits are subject to the
-- exceptional-employment procedure for תשפ"ב (an input: whether it permits
-- the employment); ¶4: the circular itself permits nothing beyond them.
@ref akn:art_1__para_h/p2 akn:art_1__para_h/p3 akn:art_1__para_h/p4
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`
      `total position with all employers` IS A NUMBER
      `permitted under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether the exceptional-employment procedure for תשפ"ב permits this employment
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the employment is within the limits` t `total position with all employers` `permitted under the exceptional-employment procedure` IF
        `total position with all employers` AT MOST `the limit on total employment in sections 1ז-1ח` t
    OR  `permitted under the exceptional-employment procedure`

@ref akn:art_1__para_g akn:art_1__para_h
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `payment action`
DECIDE `no employment beyond the limits` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `employ beyond the limit on total employment`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/6 §§1ז-1ח: employment beyond the limit on total employment needs the exceptional-employment procedure"

§§ `2 תשלום מענק יובל`

@desc The stages of employment §2ה.3 names.
DECLARE `jubilee stage` IS ONE OF
    `junior high school`
    `upper division`
    `recognised unofficial special education under Ofek Hadash`
    `teacher-training college`
    `kindergarten`
    `primary school`

@desc One part of a teaching employee's employment in the year: the stage and its share of a full position.
DECLARE `employment portion` HAS
    `portion stage`    IS A `jubilee stage`
    `portion fraction` IS A NUMBER

@desc A teaching employee as far as the jubilee grant asks about it.
DECLARE `jubilee employee` HAS
    `seniority months at the September determination` IS A NUMBER  @desc accumulated seniority in teaching, in months, as determined for the employee in the September of the year before the payment (section 2ד)
    `seniority months on 1 June`                      IS A NUMBER  @desc accumulated seniority in teaching, in months, completed by 1 June of the year of payment (section 2ה.2)
    `jubilee already paid at this threshold`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether a jubilee grant was paid in an earlier year for completing the same threshold
    `portions`                                        IS A LIST OF `employment portion`
    `share of the year employed`                      IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of the school year the employee was employed (1 = all of it)
    `determining salary for pension and severance`    IS A NUMBER  @desc the full-position salary that determines pension and severance pay, without one-off annual payments such as clothing and recuperation

-- akn:art_2__para_e The heading "הבהרות" (clarifications) of §2ה; no rule.

-- §2ה.1: a year of unpaid leave for which pension rights were bought from
-- the State Treasury or a teachers' pension fund counts in the seniority.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_1
GIVEN `months of service` IS A NUMBER, `months of unpaid leave with pension rights bought` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority months for the jubilee grant` `months of service` `months of unpaid leave with pension rights bought` IS
    `months of service` PLUS `months of unpaid leave with pension rights bought`

-- §2ה.3: the threshold by the stage of each part of the employment.
-- F-2021-22_tashpab_06-e: the teacher-training colleges are named in both
-- lists.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_3
GIVEN s IS A `jubilee stage`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the thresholds section 2ה.3 gives` s IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `junior high school` THEN LIST 25
    WHEN `upper division` THEN LIST 25
    WHEN `recognised unofficial special education under Ofek Hadash` THEN LIST 25
    WHEN `teacher-training college` THEN LIST 25, 30
    WHEN `kindergarten` THEN LIST 30
    WHEN `primary school` THEN LIST 30

`the teacher-training colleges are given two thresholds` MEANS
    `the thresholds section 2ה.3 gives` `teacher-training college` EQUALS LIST 25, 30
#ASSERT `the teacher-training colleges are given two thresholds`

-- The reading adopted (F-2021-22_tashpab_06-e): the first list, which names
-- "the academic colleges for teacher training", governs them: 25 years.
GIVEN s IS A `jubilee stage`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee threshold in years` s IS
    CONSIDER `the thresholds section 2ה.3 gives` s
    WHEN x FOLLOWED BY rest THEN x
    OTHERWISE 30

-- §2ב: entitlement by seniority of "25 או 30 שנה ומעלה", military service
-- included. Read alone, every year at or past the threshold qualifies.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN e IS A `jubilee employee`, p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 2ב alone makes the portion qualify` e p IF
    e's `seniority months on 1 June` AT LEAST `the jubilee threshold in years` (p's `portion stage`) TIMES 12

-- §2ד: the grant follows the seniority determined in September of the year
-- before the payment (whole years).
@ref akn:art_2__para_d
GIVEN e IS A `jubilee employee`, p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 2ד makes the portion qualify` e p IF
    FLOOR (e's `seniority months at the September determination` DIVIDED BY 12)
        AT LEAST `the jubilee threshold in years` (p's `portion stage`)

-- §2ה.2: completing the threshold by 1 June of the year in question entitles
-- the employee that year.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_2
GIVEN e IS A `jubilee employee`, p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 2ה.2 makes the portion qualify` e p IF
        e's `seniority months on 1 June` AT LEAST `the jubilee threshold in years` (p's `portion stage`) TIMES 12
    AND NOT e's `jubilee already paid at this threshold`

-- The reading adopted (F-2021-22_tashpab_06-c, F-2021-22_tashpab_06-d):
-- §2ה.2 decides both the date the threshold is measured on and that the
-- grant is paid once, in the year the threshold is completed.
GIVEN e IS A `jubilee employee`, p IS AN `employment portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the portion qualifies for the jubilee grant` e p IF
    `section 2ה.2 makes the portion qualify` e p

-- §2ג (printed under §2ב: see the corpus note below): the grant is 60% of
-- the determining salary for pension and severance pay.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b/p3
`the jubilee rate` MEANS 0.60

-- §2ה.4: in proportion to the year's position, up to one position, and to
-- the share of the year employed.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_4
GIVEN e IS A `jubilee employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the qualifying position share` e IS
    min 1 (sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `portion fraction`)
                    (filter (GIVEN p YIELD `the portion qualifies for the jubilee grant` e p) (e's `portions`))))

@export The jubilee grant for the school year תשפ"ב under circular תשפ"ב/6
GIVEN e IS A `jubilee employee` @desc the employee
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee grant` e IS
    `the jubilee rate`
        TIMES e's `determining salary for pension and severance`
        TIMES `the qualifying position share` e
        TIMES e's `share of the year employed`

-- §2ה.5: with more than one employer, sections 1ו-1ח apply with the
-- necessary changes: each employer pays in proportion to the qualifying
-- position held with it, up to one position at that employer (§§1ה-1ו).
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_5
GIVEN e IS A `jubilee employee`
      `portions at this employer` IS A LIST OF `employment portion` @desc the parts of the employment held with the paying employer
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee grant at an employer` e `portions at this employer` IS
    `the jubilee rate`
        TIMES e's `determining salary for pension and severance`
        TIMES min 1 (sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `portion fraction`)
                              (filter (GIVEN p YIELD `the portion qualifies for the jubilee grant` e p) `portions at this employer`)))
        TIMES e's `share of the year employed`

@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN e IS A `jubilee employee`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `payment action`
DECIDE `paying the jubilee grant with June's salary` e IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the jubilee grant` paid
          PROVIDED paid AT LEAST `the jubilee grant` e
    WITHIN `month number` June
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/6 §2א: the jubilee grant is paid with June 2022's salary"

-- Corpus note: §2ג's label "ג." is published as a paragraph of §2ב
-- (art_2__para_b/p2) and its text as the next one (p3); the rows are cited
-- above as the rule they carry.

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_06-c: a teacher in the 25-year stages whose seniority
-- was determined in September 2021 as 24 years and 6 months, and who passed
-- 25 years before 1 June 2022: §2ה.2 entitles her this year, §2ד does not.
`a junior-high teacher passing 25 years in the winter` MEANS
    `jubilee employee` WITH
        `seniority months at the September determination` IS 294
        `seniority months on 1 June`                      IS 303
        `jubilee already paid at this threshold`          IS FALSE
        `portions`                                        IS LIST `employment portion` `junior high school` 1
        `share of the year employed`                      IS 1
        `determining salary for pension and severance`    IS 10000

`sections 2ד and 2ה.2 give different years for the same teacher` MEANS
        `section 2ה.2 makes the portion qualify` `a junior-high teacher passing 25 years in the winter` (`employment portion` `junior high school` 1)
    AND NOT `section 2ד makes the portion qualify` `a junior-high teacher passing 25 years in the winter` (`employment portion` `junior high school` 1)
#ASSERT `sections 2ד and 2ה.2 give different years for the same teacher`

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_06-d: a teacher with 27 years who was paid the grant on
-- completing 25: §2ב's "ומעלה" read alone pays her again, §2ה.2 does not.
`a junior-high teacher in her 27th year` MEANS
    `jubilee employee` WITH
        `seniority months at the September determination` IS 315
        `seniority months on 1 June`                      IS 324
        `jubilee already paid at this threshold`          IS TRUE
        `portions`                                        IS LIST `employment portion` `junior high school` 1
        `share of the year employed`                      IS 1
        `determining salary for pension and severance`    IS 10000

`section 2ב read alone pays the grant again in a later year` MEANS
        `section 2ב alone makes the portion qualify` `a junior-high teacher in her 27th year` (`employment portion` `junior high school` 1)
    AND NOT `section 2ה.2 makes the portion qualify` `a junior-high teacher in her 27th year` (`employment portion` `junior high school` 1)
#ASSERT `section 2ב read alone pays the grant again in a later year`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: the telephone numbers for questions, the signatures and the list of copies; no rule.

-- Worked examples. The salary of 10,000 is a placeholder: the circular
-- leaves the determining salary to the employee's pay.
`a teacher in her 22nd year on a full position` MEANS
    `recuperation employee` 22 (LIST `employment at an employer` 1)
`a teacher in her 2nd year at two employers` MEANS
    `recuperation employee` 2 (LIST `employment at an employer` 0.7, `employment at an employer` 0.5)

#ASSERT `the recuperation allowance from all employers` `a teacher in her 22nd year on a full position` EQUALS 5388
#ASSERT `the recuperation allowance from all employers` `a teacher in her 2nd year at two employers` EQUALS 3771.60
#ASSERT `the recuperation allowance owed by the employer` `a teacher in her 22nd year on a full position` (`employment at an employer` 1.2) EQUALS 5388
#ASSERT `the year's position fraction` (LIST 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5) EQUALS 0.7
#ASSERT `the employment is within the limits` `a teacher under Ofek Hadash` 1.2 FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the employment is within the limits` `a principal not employed under a reform` 1.45 FALSE

`a teacher in two stages` MEANS
    `jubilee employee` WITH
        `seniority months at the September determination` IS 300
        `seniority months on 1 June`                      IS 309
        `jubilee already paid at this threshold`          IS FALSE
        `portions`                                        IS LIST `employment portion` `junior high school` 0.5, `employment portion` `primary school` 0.5
        `share of the year employed`                      IS 1
        `determining salary for pension and severance`    IS 10000

-- 25 years: the junior-high half qualifies, the primary half needs 30.
#ASSERT `the jubilee grant` `a teacher in two stages` EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT `the jubilee grant` `a junior-high teacher passing 25 years in the winter` EQUALS 6000
#ASSERT `the jubilee grant at an employer` `a teacher in two stages` (LIST `employment portion` `junior high school` 0.5) EQUALS 3000

#TRACE `paying the recuperation allowance with June's salary` `a teacher in her 22nd year on a full position` 5388 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the recuperation allowance in full` 5388 AT 10
#TRACE `paying the jubilee grant with June's salary` `a teacher in two stages` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the jubilee grant` 3000 AT 10
